sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Home as HomeScreen
    participant Session as LipsCameraSession
    participant Settings as DetectorSettings
    participant Ext as MediaPipeExtractor
    participant Native as FaceLandmarkerBridge
    participant Cam as Camera plugin

    User->>Home: opens Home screen
    Home->>Home: addPostFrameCallback
    Note over Home: waits one frame so the<br/>spinner is visible first
    Home->>Session: initialize(onUpdate)

    Session->>Session: initPhase = "Loading settings..."
    Session->>Settings: load()
    Settings-->>Session: thresholds
    Session->>Session: rebuild both detectors

    Session->>Session: initPhase = "Loading face landmarker..."
    Session->>Ext: initialize()
    Ext->>Native: initializeFaceLandmarker
    Note over Native: runs on the MAIN thread<br/>(Android 15/16 crash fix)
    Native->>Native: load face_landmarker.task
    alt model file missing
        Native-->>Ext: error model_missing
        Ext-->>Session: throws Exception
        Session->>Home: error set
        Home->>User: error screen + Try Again
    else model loaded
        Native-->>Ext: success
    end

    Session->>Session: initPhase = "Starting camera..."
    Session->>Cam: availableCameras()
    Cam-->>Session: camera list
    Session->>Cam: initialize front camera
    Note over Session,Cam: tries veryHigh, then high,<br/>then medium
    Cam-->>Session: ready
    Session->>Cam: startImageStream(_onFrame)
    Session->>Session: initPhase = "Ready"
    Session->>Home: onUpdate()
    Home->>User: live preview appears
